content Profile the spread deviation distribution across datasets.
	
	## Goal
	Understand the statistical properties of spread deviation (spread - EMA baseline) to optimize entry thresholds.
	
	## Analysis
	- Histogram of deviations per dataset/coin
	- Measure autocorrelation of spread signals
	- Find optimal thresholds by analyzing hit rates
	- Compare deviation distributions across market conditions
	
	## Metrics to Collect
	- Mean, stddev, skewness, kurtosis of deviations
	- Time-series autocorrelation at various lags
	- Threshold crossing frequency at 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 bps
	- Conditional probability: P(profit | deviation > X)
